{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "116d7ee95cd1729d918d9774d2ad9aee5fadc9625c5352f483323a83d5cf0f69", "ja": "楽しいディナーを終え、まだまだ元気一杯の\n翼は、美希の部屋に遊びに行く。その後、\n部屋に戻ったはずののり子と美奈子が星空を\n眺めている所に遭遇するプロデューサー。\n歌詞のため、明日も全力で楽しむ事に。", "zh": "开心的晚餐时间结束后，\n依然充满活力的翼跑去美希房间玩。\n在那之后，制作人碰见应该已经回房间的\n法子跟美奈子，她们正在眺望星空。\n为了歌词，她们决定明天也要尽情享受假期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "740ee510c6f83431d05953e57fa5b177c6ed39ec012bcb6d9f1f5cd196c74ca4", "ja": "（ディナーを終え、ヴィラにチェックイン。\nバカンス1日目は無事に終了……ってところかな）", "zh": "（吃完晚餐，也办好度假别墅入住手续。\n假期的第一天……算是平安结束了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ead57a58f1f90bd3a4a52127c16b17a886c928fa5597102db476770373529f58", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n部屋とディナーの感想は、どうだ？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n房间跟晚餐觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0367a66248c937aaedc08d5a186b07be8dcf675ca93a80e8adac0221dd6a9a43", "ja": "もう最高！　ここ、水上ヴィラっていうんですよね？\nオシャレで涼しくて、気持ちいい～♪", "zh": "超级棒的！这里是那种水上别墅对吧？\n既时髦又凉爽，住起来很舒服～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "34e079d80fa7fa5d64cba558e3c14a992507ad6240bb1bcbe6df1d73e81b7b42", "ja": "ホント！　水上デスマッチのリングみたいで、\nテンション上がっちゃうよ！", "zh": "就是说啊！感觉就像站在水上殊死战的擂台上一样，\n让人兴奋得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "67b6997ea8770da78674e536ea313ee2858bc3354ff0227bc5d3db0aa1a42b7a", "ja": "ディナーもトロピカルでスパイシーで、すっごく\nおいしかったです！　香辛料の配合教えてほしいなぁ。", "zh": "晚餐充满热带风情，浓浓的香料味非常好吃！\n真想向他们请教辛香料的配方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "34bcb06ca5b47504e3373c2cdbba28524876d798e67ad66f3774beea99b089b7", "ja": "お気に召したなら、何よりだ。\n他には……何か、困った事とかなかったか？", "zh": "你们喜欢真是太好了。\n至于其他方面……有碰到什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8e417f2d51d4e8de739ba1ea666049e648f6fdae949dd8602c321cd7993cf954", "ja": "あ。そういえば、美奈子さんが……。", "zh": "啊，这么说来，美奈子她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "010edb5c965641b2f434a02d36efea54a2d02eb83b856e0605428c6415e401bb", "ja": "ま、待って翼ちゃん！", "zh": "等、等等，小翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ac38a4dc22df9ae5227fb3444203ad99be99a164c18237b6cffeb7119bd9f59f", "ja": "美奈子が……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "美奈子……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "96b61c2d7aadfe1949df96617c7d2263f1bcb7704ad4e7cd6bc50c70bbf84f2c", "ja": "何でもありません、何でもありませんよ！\n困ったことなんて何もありませんでしたから！", "zh": "什么事都没发生，什么都没有！\n我完全没有碰到任何问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9ef4b9acc77dd0b51dc7067c4d10f0287d32aae38e6619e1d6258bd5d3d51ab1", "ja": "そ、そうか？　別に些細な事でもいいから、\n何かあるなら隠さずに話してほしいんだが……。", "zh": "是、是吗？什么小事都没关系，\n希望你们可以毫无保留地跟我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "a626fc6b5d00c543ef421715c7272906574d98eaf4d11a0efd84fd3921387dd3", "ja": "あー！　そういえば美奈子。\nウェイターさんに話しかけられてテンパってた！", "zh": "啊──！这么说来，刚刚服务生跟我们说话的时候，\n美奈子超级慌张的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "7ceca5c6bcb3ba3629d5d230228428d896fab0badc60bd30b11c63123eecb0fa", "ja": "ああっ……！？", "zh": "哎唷……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "11670a8bc18f703e0ff3b19a04b785578553b1351b8eb3e33a1d528b10b02738", "ja": "英語で話しかけられて、とっさに英語で返したんだけど\n……『ご注文は以上ですか？』って言ってなかった？", "zh": "那时候人家讲英文，美奈子也马上用英文回话了，\n不过……你那时讲的好像是『还需要其他餐点吗』？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "9aeb4cecc911dcce5d371a38e45406ea072a8fda8478bf3c2f1abc36d4217ccd", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、やめてぇ～！", "zh": "小法，别说了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2c60a1ccaca6386a28e4d5c346d13969158d3ab5599148efd5ece681361f4a8d", "ja": "あはは♪\nウェイターさん、苦笑いしてましたよね～。", "zh": "啊哈哈♪\n那时候服务生露出了一脸无奈的笑容呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2d90b847b686e7b7b8671d7dd14369d6614c4bd3ec5919adbd1b9f2eac475929", "ja": "い、いきなりだったから、お店に外国人のお客様が\n来たときのマニュアルで答えちゃって……。", "zh": "因、因为实在太突然，我一不小心就用\n店里碰到外国客人光临时的会话回答了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "568e6d1f51ce7a06270e1afbc54fb1719b9856c698549eb35abc9ab32add2a17", "ja": "うう……こんな恥ずかしい思いをするくらいなら、\n英会話をちゃんと勉強しとけばよかった……。", "zh": "呜呜……早知道会出这么大的糗，\n之前应该好好学英文会话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "1e72da8bc55154afc13ea02be90a0647d1dbb670b75a4023463260638a52b48a", "ja": "元気出しなよ、美奈子。\n不意打ちだったし、仕方ないって！", "zh": "打起精神来吧，美奈子。\n毕竟来得太突然了，也是没办法的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f697bd9f7ce0ae0ecf231183031cb27d65832eb8afd8d0ea96ef386bea653c53", "ja": "……そう言うのり子は、大丈夫だったのか？", "zh": "……说了这么多，法子你自己的英文没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "67345e191f7e9cf96fd8d191c61fb489f442166b9607fa1b086cddd6f9a8b9e1", "ja": "うん！　全部翼にまかせたからね！", "zh": "嗯！我全都交给翼处理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5373fe42c7fa98f6053aab33a8097b286709969a18bbd02cd98b4d8fb0ca35ea", "ja": "翼に？　翼、英語得意なのか？", "zh": "给翼处理？翼，你的英文很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "36a9d6eebd2cda9b96a9756edc500714839d7e80258679765f9e591344412270", "ja": "わたしも全然話せないんですけど、\nボディランゲージで何とかなっちゃいました♪", "zh": "我也完全不会讲啦，\n不过靠肢体语言勉强能沟通♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "3884c00df421031aef26446f478a8c45eb1bd13ba10dbd457d60f4395439766b", "ja": "うう……翼ちゃんより私のほうが年上なのに、\n頼りにならなくてごめんね……。", "zh": "呜呜……我明明比小翼年长，\n却没办法帮到大家，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b05522c13c632eda34277a2fe1716747ffa60719237a96a73923bc6435bdb0e3", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、美奈子さん！\nわたしにまかせちゃってください♪", "zh": "不要紧的，美奈子！\n交给我就好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58fcc48d5a8357a3d0e081094ea34b6a10fc2b905f2c19f601c0f55366f9a867", "ja": "あ！　そうだ、わたし美希ちゃんの部屋行かなきゃ！\nちょっと遊びに行ってきま～す！", "zh": "啊！差点忘了，我得到美希房间去！\n我去玩玩就回来喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a445586fa2a35bad9b1e10f184810eba57f1fd54d2493840b0e66f821162f130", "ja": "今からか……\nちゃんと消灯時間までには戻ってくるんだぞ？", "zh": "现在才去吗……\n记得在熄灯前回来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b81068014ad5f3307c76bb7c5a0aba4fa0498c7ca71f792e7c5fffb0f7f6090f", "ja": "は～い！\n心配しないで、先に寝ちゃってもいいですよ～！", "zh": "好的～！\n不用担心我，你们可以先睡没关系～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "eb826c8e13b0286663ee513fddc11f8e8208ee20d7ebe6280c1eec2700bd0312", "ja": "あはは。ああいうところは、まだまだ子どもだね。", "zh": "啊哈哈，她这种地方，感觉就还像个孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "08010525a20189afb0618815c14594ac9f148c034774ff7033adb554516f61c3", "ja": "のり子達は、美希の部屋に行かないのか？", "zh": "法子你们没有要一起去美希的房间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca2d3ded6d950615d73f4f85383fae7348764a5c0e657cf10e1068a48ba29ff1", "ja": "楽しそうだけど、さすがに今日はもう無理！\n疲れちゃったし、部屋でゆっくりしたいかな……。", "zh": "虽然感觉很好玩，但我今天真的不行了！\n整个人快累死，比较想回房间休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "70446858a5a8010c73dd62eb9669b23a51e95b1cf2d534dbaccc2cfb6b604108", "ja": "何時間も飛行機で移動した後に、そのまま海だもんね。\n私も、もうクタクタ……。", "zh": "毕竟今天搭了好几小时的飞机，\n接着又马上跑去海边玩了嘛，我也已经不行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "2938e0f336023bd18b5d4fd48443a523dbbb8e5881074c8ced8c0b7805d4fee4", "ja": "はは、さすがに体力の限界か。\n俺も部屋に戻るから、何かあったら声をかけてくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，你们的体力应该都透支了吧。\n我也先回房间去，有什么事的话跟我说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "ce09ea4c26783df8b16baec2794a27b5394df16c330e791fb3b7f0e84e39d64f", "ja": "それじゃあ、また明日な。", "zh": "那就明天见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1035_null", "source_sha256": "877ea27d4413183067e3026b8516c5f6328ee82f4fb0785cf309eacb3ac5af48", "ja": "それから数時間後……。", "zh": "接着几小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "675672cef13e0e66224dde0c704050520b596a7ef1c678dad17012c7c57739a4", "ja": "（バカンスの余韻のせいか、なんだか眠れないな……\n明日も予定があるし、早く休まないとなんだけど）", "zh": "（可能是因为度假的兴奋感吧，有点睡不着……\n但明天也有行程，得早点休息才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "35481a0f1be774c1d85257b9608235918257f07f60590f87cf5187cffdaa9691", "ja": "……ん？　あそこにいるのは……。", "zh": "……嗯？在那边的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "a88225c42c50741611ece02f56a174a6ba961d87d8dc702ae18c4bc2c2656944", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}だ。\nどしたの？　夜の見回り？", "zh": "咦，是{$P$}。\n你在做什么？晚上的巡逻吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "f5ba7a6f99f86524176f38a01ddad43f49596a33485c363461b83bf07642eef2", "ja": "夜遅くまで、お仕事お疲れさまです。\nでも、あんまり無理しちゃダメですよ？", "zh": "工作到这么晚，辛苦你了。\n不过，可别太勉强自己了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "d8d0358a4f5211ab48a1c5eb2d8f56e86fa51df43bd8cd952662e6feb5547888", "ja": "いや、それはこっちのセリフだよ。\nふたりとも、休むんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "不，我才想问你们呢。\n你们不是回去休息了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "b566c46e4076722a041eea8ea738210b73ac6414b3cb0841eea0c4f61dcff4b4", "ja": "いやー、そのつもりで布団に入ったんだけどさ。\nテンション上がりすぎてたみたいで。", "zh": "哎唷──我原本是这么想的，都已经躺进棉被里了，\n结果精神还是很亢奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1042_019min", "source_sha256": "18ac4bbd043051b30a7f7eeb37aee06da03995c2a8ba43b8b40ae66b5d9ea3a2", "ja": "体は疲れてるのに、全然寝つけませんでした。", "zh": "明明身体累得不行，却完全睡不着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "56216c3977d4632e799253dfd291e48648e1cf22b566bcd73615297555ca3ba4", "ja": "なんだ、ふたりもそうなのか……。\n実は恥ずかしいけど、俺も同じみたいなんだ。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来你们也是这样……\n说来难为情，但我好像也跟你们一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "9e6c5c325b6d942ca8efb5b85ac719f22d041dc18a7167a4d7cb8622681e16c8", "ja": "それなら、こっちで一緒に空を眺めませんか？\n南国の星空、絶景ですよ！", "zh": "那要不要来这里一起观赏夜空呢？\n南国的星空，超级美丽的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "adc549d51671be4b2980f44005c1bced2b206c013a168a72fe80ff42e008495d", "ja": "そういえばさ、翼はちゃんと戻ってきたか？\n連絡がないから、大丈夫だと思うけど……。", "zh": "这么一说，翼回来了吗？\n我没收到你们的联络，应该是没问题吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "b1703e820b9d4b2326a92ec9115d851e70b12317f12b448be6c5cdf054c0775c", "ja": "あ、言うの忘れてた！　律子さんから連絡があって、\n美希達の部屋ではしゃいでたら、力尽きて寝たって。", "zh": "啊，我忘记跟你说了！律子姊有跟我们说，刚刚翼在\n美希她们的房间玩得太开心，结果累到直接睡着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "de5b794bcf9ad7fe12d3da47b92b74b21f086702cd9e98f2374c91343954e9b0", "ja": "ふふふ、電池が切れちゃったんだね。\nなんだか赤ちゃんみたいでかわいいですね♪", "zh": "呵呵呵，电池没电了呢。\n感觉就像小宝宝一样，真可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "982a4420188221217b50465f275241358f911bdbb6fa0bb2ce948c9f218b307c", "ja": "ま、興奮して眠れなくなってるアタシらも、\n翼のことを子どもだーって言えないけどね！", "zh": "不过，我们自己也是兴奋到睡不着，\n实在没有资格说翼像小孩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "4d17dca51dccab53212cc2a81f8e2b3a8168f73e858b3c99e290f3a57bf7bb5c", "ja": "はは。\nそれを言われると、俺も耳が痛いな。", "zh": "哈哈。\n这句话好像也戳到我的痛点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e3f50d567cd99d1daae021f0d890b9b2d88284fed76616af8d90ffb5490d334", "ja": "でも……なんかさ、こういうの楽しいね。\n同じユニットの、ちょっとだけ年の違う子との旅行！", "zh": "不过……这种旅行挺好玩的呢。\n旅伴是同一个团体中，年纪有些差距的女生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "9f1a66276f67961c899ebb25505c0d85ead93c10812367cc586f7748ea82d179", "ja": "1日の出来事を振り返りながら、\nこうやってキレイな星空を見上げてる……。", "zh": "像这样看着美丽的星空，\n一边回想今天的种种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1052_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ff216a84228fd571e310d3ca434899aad485cc9727766c738c0292583c159c7", "ja": "アタシ、みんなとバカンスに来れて本当によかった！\n明日も遊びまくろうね！", "zh": "我有跟大家一起来度假真是太好了！\n明天也要玩个痛快喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1053_019min", "source_sha256": "f99b6fe9bda005ae547ab59717faf6a0d64a0dfc71b8ce43a1c1d5fbfd98a70b", "ja": "うん！　島の隅々まで、探検しちゃおう！\nいいですよね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嗯！我们把整座岛屿都探险一遍吧！\n应该可以吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "510dac9e75763a5c8af0a28bc12e3cb4fd81ae531996361ba23e31e756db2ffc", "ja": "もちろんいいけど、歌詞のほうは……。", "zh": "自然是没问题，不过歌词的部分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1055_043nor", "source_sha256": "156535e982fc805097a43c5787cb3a26e4c929430e8c7661641887163ad87594", "ja": "わかってるってば！\nもう、{$P$}はホント心配性だなぁ。", "zh": "我们知道啦！\n真是的，{$P$}就是爱操心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1056_p", "source_sha256": "64c8eb7bbe9ec788d17fd2dd70002348cc13459e851e96e39944f9518c83c30f", "ja": "大事なアイドルだから心配してるんだよ。\nそれに、3人の歌詞が、楽しみでもあるからな。", "zh": "因为你们是重要的偶像，我才会担心啊。\n而且，我也很期待你们三个会写出什么样的歌词喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1057_043nor", "source_sha256": "4650076f572137d0386270f0b142338bf651c37dd5c15c156deebf4b8dbe4590", "ja": "うぐ、地味な圧力を感じる……。でも良い歌詞のため、\nまずバカンスを楽しむ！　間違ってないよね！？", "zh": "唔呃，这样说反而让人压力很大……不过，为了写出\n好歌词，总之要好好享受假期！这点应该没错吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "f6a2c8162a8e1a3e539237e595e9897ae9d7e00cf20e1db525b1c80ac612750a", "ja": "ああ、そこは間違ってないよ。\n明日も存分に、南の島を満喫してくれ！", "zh": "嗯，就是这样没错。\n你们明天也尽情享受南岛风情吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1059_043nor", "source_sha256": "b67a3525f1aa0668ef5cf0dc04e98f30b06aaaca80cf889de79bebcedbd85df0", "ja": "うん！　よーし、そうと決まれば……。\n明日も全力でバカンス体験しまくるぞー！", "zh": "嗯！好，既然决定了……\n明天也要尽全力体验假期喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0076_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_03_1060_019min", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "哦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
